        <mxCell id="c267" value="Growth 50% Sensitivity" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F3F4;strokeColor=#D5D8DC;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="699" width="196" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c268" value="&lt;b&gt;Prices&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A5276;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1A5276;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="198" y="699" width="70" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c269" value="Standards" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F3F4;strokeColor=#D5D8DC;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="699" width="92" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c270" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined in coral: the seven families whose margin on time-driven cost is below the 40% floor; only they have a target price, an increase, a volume they can lose and a revenue. The shaded cells of column G are Goal Seek&#x27;s changing cells, and column I computes the same price directly. The increase, the volume it can lose and the revenue read column I. The volume the increase can lose is the formula in the bar: one minus the contribution per unit now, over that contribution plus the increase per unit. Columns H, K and O are hidden here (O says whether Goal Seek agrees with column I), and the columns are narrower than the workbook&#x27;s. The totals read 556,535 a year if volume holds. Of the families bought in Requirement 6, three are among those below the floor, so 246,311 a year is what the other four bring.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="729" width="860" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
